<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle off $1.00/2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle off $1.00/2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were $1.00-2.00 lower than late last week in slow trade. - USDA</p>
<p>Steers - High-Select and Choice 2-3, 1100-1350 lbs</p>
<p>65.00-66.50, Select and Choice 2-3, 1100-1300 lbs 62.00-65.00, Select 1-2, 59.00-62.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - High-Select and Choice 2-3, 1050-1250 lbs</p>
<p>64.50-66.50, Select and Choice 2-3, 1000-1125 lbs 61.00-64.50, Select 1-2, 58.50-61.00.</p>
</text>
